<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Your young men will be to you like</l><l>The dew from the womb of the dawn</l><l>The dew from the womb of the dawn</l><l>The dew from the womb of the dawn</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Young men be</l><l>Like the dew</l><l>The dew of the dawn</l><l>The dew of the dawn</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>He will drink from the brook by the way</l><l>He will drink from the brook by the way</l><l>Therefore He will lift up His head</l><l>Therefore He will lift up His head</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>He will drink</l><l>From the brook</l><l>Lift up His head</l><l>Lift up His head</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>
